.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 
CPP-API: Interface to the file system\&. 

Derive an own implementation from this interface to supply custom file handling to the importer library\&. If you implement this interface, you also want to supply a custom implementation for \fBIOStream\fP\&.
.PP
\fBSee also\fP
.RS 4
\fBImporter::SetIOHandler()\fP 
.RE
.PP

.SH "Constructor & Destructor Documentation"
